{"id":"vod_md_3953","vodId":"3953","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"游戏人生","name_cn":"游戏人生","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230902-1/23ff6c76a7e16ae96f4f9f9cb7f76b12.jpg"},"summary":"空（松冈祯丞 配音）和白（茅野爱衣）是网络世界里人尽皆知的传奇人物，两人在虚拟的战斗中所向披靡，甚至被称为传说一般的存在。然而，在现实世界中，兄妹两人却是连家门都不敢出的“御宅族”，患有严重的人群恐惧症。某日，空和白收到了一位陌生少年传来的讯息，因而被召唤到了异世界中 ，在这里，人类种、森精种、天翼种和机凯种生活在同一片土地之上，这里没有战争和暴力，有的只是一场又一场无休无止的游戏，一切利益和权利，皆由游戏的结果决定。弱势的人类种在游戏中节节败退最终蜗居在最后一片净土之上，空和白的到来能否改变这悲惨的现状？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-02 08:02:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/d8Ir4xDZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/RT6ogahT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/HucJVgTk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/jTyv0zNy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/WZNGlFrr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/CRhU2Stf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/GiAV9TKk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/9tBtLolV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/sluP4tXJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/MuqcCBW1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/sJ3yvZBP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230830/atLdQxrt/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:29.266Z"}